Package: HeteroSpaSim
Type: Package
Title: Simulation and Benchmarking of Heterogeneous Spatial Multi-Omics Data
Version: 0.1.9.9000
Authors@R: person("HeteroSpaSim Development Team", email = "wzhang_math@whu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A controllable simulation and benchmarking framework for heterogeneous
    spatial multi-omics data. HeteroSpaSim separates latent tissue biology from
    modality-specific biological programs and heterogeneous spatial measurement
    processes. It supports RNA, chromatin-accessibility and protein modalities,
    cell- and spot-resolution measurements, paired and partially paired designs,
    mosaic coverage, spatial misalignment, missing modalities, batch effects,
    complete ground truth, reference calibration and reproducible benchmark suites.
